      "does": "At the start of every run it offers three pearls: she takes one." },
    { "id": "spare_bell", "title": "Spare Bell", "biome": "Kelp Forest", "depth": 2,
      "line": "A ship's bell gone green, still ringing faintly when the water moves.",
      "does": "She starts every run with one more light pip." },
    { "id": "shell_urn", "title": "Shell Urn", "biome": "Shipwreck Graveyard", "depth": 3,
